<p>Every request to the <a href="/apis/index">Godzilla API</a> is authenticated with a bearer API key.</p>

<h2>Getting an API key</h2>
<p>Generate one from your workspace settings. Keys are scoped to a single workspace and inherit the standard rate limit described in <a href="/apis/rate-limits-errors">Rate limits & errors</a>.</p>

